1. POST https://{hostname}/api/login​
Returns AtmoAuthToken Cookie

2.GET https://{hostname}/api/apis​
Returns list of all APIs on the platform along with API Ids

3.GET https://{hostname}/api/apis/{APIID}/versions​
Returns Versions & VersionID for the Requested API

4. GET
https://{hostname}/api/apis/versions/implementations?APIVersio
nID=​
Returns the ImplementationCode

5. 
https://{hostname}/api/apis/versions/{ApiVersionID}/implementat
ions/{ImplCode}/policies​

Returns policies assigned to the specified implementation​

6. GET
https://{hostname}/api/apis/versions/{APIVersionID}/definition/oa
s3?Environment=​

Returns Open API 3.0 specification​

7.GET https://{hostname}/api/apis/versions/{APIVersionID}/package​

Exports full configuration including settings, config, security
artifacts​​​​​

